Finitely presented infinite p-groups for every prime
Copyright 2026 Seth Douglas and Nidhal Mghirbi

The paper builds on two preprints of OpenAI's mathematics release, https://github.com/openai/math:
"An infinite finitely presented periodic group" (23 September 2026) and "An infinite finitely presented
residually finite 2-group" (5 October 2026). The construction and the principal methods are OpenAI's work; the
paper says, step by step, which arguments hold as written over F_p and which are replaced, and gives an account
of credit in its introduction and in Section 10.

No OpenAI source text, code or Lean file is redistributed in this repository. OpenAI's material is referenced by
commit and must be obtained from the repository above, under its own terms.
